# Rule: Supabase & celestial

Migrations: timestamp-prefixed, append-only history. RLS must match how the app queries.

**Read first:** `CLAUDE.md` (naming, route groups), `supabase/schema.sql`, `supabase/auth-rls.sql`.

**Process:** `sentinel/MAINTENANCE.md` — almost every policy change needs a pattern or ADR note.
